[00:00.50]She played the fiddle in an Irish band
{"她曾在爱尔兰乐队演奏小提琴"}
[00:02.70]But she fell in love with an English man
{"却爱上了一个英格兰男人"}
[00:04.92]Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand
{"轻吻她后颈 再牵起她的手"}
[00:07.50]Said, "Baby, I just wanna dance"
{"说着「亲爱的 我只想跳舞」"}}
[00:09.36]I met her on Grafton street right outside of the bar
{"在格拉夫顿街的酒吧外与她相遇"}
[00:12.14]She shared a cigarette with me while her brother played the guitar
{"她与我分享香烟 她兄弟弹着吉他"}
[00:14.60]She asked me what does it mean, the Gaelic ink on your arm?
{"她问我手臂上的盖尔语纹身含义"}
[00:16.84]Said it was one of my friend's songs, do you want to drink on?
{"我说是朋友的歌 要再来一杯吗"}
[00:19.32]She took Jamie as a chaser, Jack for the fun
{"她喝杰米追酒 杰克只为尽兴"}
[00:21.76]She got Arthur on the table, with Johnny riding as shot gun
{"亚瑟酒摆上桌 强尼酒伴身旁"}
[00:24.27]Chatted some more, one more drink at the bar
{"又聊了会儿 在酒吧再饮一杯"}
[00:26.54]Then put Van on the jukebox, got up to dance, you know
{"点播范的歌 起身共舞 你知道"}
