[00:38.26]With my pretty little Galway Girl
{"与我美丽的戈尔韦姑娘共舞"}
[00:40.56]You're my pretty little Galway Girl
{"你是我美丽的戈尔韦姑娘"}
[00:47.54]You know she beat me at darts and then she beat me at pool
{"她飞镖赢了我 台球又胜一局"}
[00:50.59]And then she kissed me like there was nobody else in the room
{"随后吻我 仿佛房间只剩你我"}
[00:52.93]As last orders were called was when she stood on the stool
{"打烊时分 她站上酒吧高凳"}
[00:55.24]After dancing the céili singing to trad tunes
{"跳完凯利舞 唱着传统歌谣"}
[00:57.83]I never heard Carrickfergus ever sung so sweet
{"从未听过如此甜美的卡里克弗格斯"}
[01:00.06]Acapella in the bar using her feet for a beat
{"她在酒吧无伴奏 用脚打拍子"}
[01:02.49]Oh, I could have that voice playing on repeat for a week
{"这歌声让我循环播放一整周"}
[01:04.76]And in this packed out room swear she was singing to me
{"在这拥挤的房间里 我发誓她正为我歌唱"}
